WEBVTT

00:01.087 --> 00:03.137
♪

00:05.677 --> 00:07.637
[voices crying and whimpering]

00:14.477 --> 00:15.977
[metal gate unlocking]

00:17.487 --> 00:19.277
[MAN]
Lookie, another friend for you.

00:19.357 --> 00:23.157
Make sure you play nice now,
until tomorrow.

00:23.237 --> 00:25.197
[both laughing wickedly]

00:28.037 --> 00:30.617
Hey, um, are you all right?

00:30.707 --> 00:31.917
[GIRL 1] Yes.

00:32.667 --> 00:34.247
Thanks for checking on me.

00:34.337 --> 00:35.587
[all exclaiming]

00:35.667 --> 00:37.877
-Now, if you'll excuse me.
-[all gasp]

00:38.917 --> 00:40.467
[effort grunting]

00:43.467 --> 00:44.547
Let's see.

00:47.267 --> 00:48.387
-[thuds]
-[all yelp]

00:49.137 --> 00:50.097
[GIRL 1] Hmm.

00:51.387 --> 00:53.897
Hmm. Come, follow me, please.

00:53.977 --> 00:55.517
[all exclaim]

00:55.607 --> 00:57.897
-Huh?
-Okay.

00:57.987 --> 01:00.447
[men laughing]

01:00.527 --> 01:02.487
[indistinct chattering]

01:05.027 --> 01:05.987
Hmm.

01:07.037 --> 01:09.247
Now, I need you to wait here.

01:09.327 --> 01:11.497
Huh? [exclaims worriedly]

01:11.577 --> 01:13.747
-[GIRL 1] Good evening.
-[MAN] You!

01:13.827 --> 01:16.747
You're that-- [grunts]
How dare you?

01:16.837 --> 01:18.917
-[yelps]
-[objects breaking]

01:19.007 --> 01:21.427
-[door creaking open]
-Huh?

01:21.507 --> 01:23.467
Thank you for your patience.

01:23.547 --> 01:25.927
-Right, let's go.
-[men groaning]

01:26.007 --> 01:27.427
[GIRL 2] Uh-huh, right.

01:31.927 --> 01:33.727
-[MAN] What have we here?
-[girls gasp]

01:33.807 --> 01:35.187
Where do you think you're going?

01:35.267 --> 01:37.517
[laughing wickedly]

01:37.607 --> 01:38.977
I don't know
how the hell you got out,

01:39.067 --> 01:41.067
but I'm dragging you ba--
[grunts]

01:41.567 --> 01:43.527
Hmm? [groans]

01:46.317 --> 01:48.697
♪

01:48.787 --> 01:50.697
[men groaning]

01:52.327 --> 01:53.537
I'm sorry about that.

01:54.327 --> 01:55.917
They can't hurt you anymore.

01:56.627 --> 01:58.957
[wailing]

01:59.957 --> 02:01.917
[all crying]

02:08.637 --> 02:10.097
[crying]

02:10.177 --> 02:11.887
We were so scared!

02:11.977 --> 02:13.057
Thank you!

02:13.137 --> 02:15.847
Thank you so much
for rescuing us!

02:16.647 --> 02:18.647
Thank you for saving our lives.

02:18.727 --> 02:19.977
[GIRL 3] Thank you!

02:20.067 --> 02:21.437
[all continue crying]

02:21.527 --> 02:22.857
[GIRL 1] You can breathe.

02:22.937 --> 02:24.777
-It's okay, Princess Olivia.
-[gasps]

02:25.447 --> 02:27.527
Hey, how did you know who I am?

02:28.197 --> 02:29.867
I'm so glad that you're safe.

02:29.947 --> 02:32.247
You're Olivia Arnold,
second in line, right?

02:32.327 --> 02:33.247
Oh.

02:33.907 --> 02:36.287
I am. And who are you?

02:36.377 --> 02:39.337
I'm an Astral
serving the great Arnold Army.

02:39.417 --> 02:40.837
My name is Lily.

02:42.797 --> 02:44.757
[gasps]

02:45.627 --> 02:46.637
[OLIVIA] Who knew

02:47.137 --> 02:50.297
that night would be the very
first time I met Ray White.

03:00.267 --> 03:01.227
[sighs]

03:03.937 --> 03:05.987
I need more Ray White
in my life.

03:06.657 --> 03:08.527
[♪ opening theme song playing]

03:34.267 --> 03:35.767
[GIRL] Hi, Ray. Good morning!

03:35.847 --> 03:38.307
-Hey, Elisa.
-Is, uh, everything all right?

03:38.977 --> 03:41.437
Yeah, something seems
different about you.

03:41.517 --> 03:42.647
You think so?

03:42.727 --> 03:45.317
I guess I could say the same.

03:45.397 --> 03:46.317
Oh, yeah?

03:58.667 --> 03:59.957
♪

04:04.917 --> 04:08.007
So then, regarding
the other day's incident,

04:08.087 --> 04:10.047
you mean to tell us
that Evan Bernstein

04:10.137 --> 04:11.427
pulled this off on his own?

04:11.507 --> 04:13.547
Up until now,
there's been no movement

04:13.637 --> 04:15.257
from the Eugenics' main forces.

04:15.347 --> 04:17.217
I would argue
it's a fair assumption.

04:17.307 --> 04:19.057
And Paratrogo, who helped Evan,

04:19.137 --> 04:21.307
is locked away
in a special prison.

04:22.307 --> 04:23.357
So, Evan...

04:24.017 --> 04:25.857
I'm afraid he's dead.

04:26.817 --> 04:28.697
The Hale clan came in
and cleaned up

04:28.777 --> 04:30.147
when all was done.

04:30.237 --> 04:31.317
Hmm.

04:32.027 --> 04:34.367
Oh, Lydia,
I've been meaning to ask,

04:34.447 --> 04:36.497
-how is he doing?
-[exclaims]

04:36.577 --> 04:39.247
Oh, you know,
I'd say he's flourishing.

04:39.327 --> 04:41.667
He's got his school life
and plenty of good friends.

04:42.827 --> 04:45.337
I could be wrong, but I think
it's exactly the kind

04:45.417 --> 04:46.547
of environment
he needs right now.

04:46.627 --> 04:47.797
[chuckles]

04:49.087 --> 04:51.217
It might help him
face what's coming,

04:51.297 --> 04:53.297
and much sooner
than I anticipated.

04:53.887 --> 04:55.097
♪

04:55.557 --> 04:57.467
-[GIRL 1] Hey, did you hear?
-[GIRL 2] You mean that thing?

04:57.557 --> 04:59.597
[GIRL 3]
If it's about White, then...

04:59.677 --> 05:01.097
What? [exclaims]

05:01.187 --> 05:02.477
[GIRL 2] Keep it in your pants!

05:02.557 --> 05:04.557
I'm talking about
the Magicks War!

05:04.647 --> 05:05.857
Oh, yeah.

05:06.357 --> 05:08.437
That's the new team battle where
basically anyone can group up,

05:08.527 --> 05:10.447
regardless of their school
or grade level, right?

05:10.527 --> 05:12.107
I heard it's supposed
to take place

05:12.197 --> 05:13.947
before the choir event, too.

05:14.027 --> 05:16.327
[GIRL 1] I remember.
White's thing.

05:16.407 --> 05:17.537
[BOTH] Really?

05:17.907 --> 05:20.367
[BOY] This new event
is three people per team, right?

05:20.447 --> 05:22.457
[GIRL 4]
I bet Al's gonna enter, too.

05:22.537 --> 05:24.167
Yeah, I'd assume so,

05:24.247 --> 05:25.877
but if Wisel and I
end up on his team,

05:25.957 --> 05:27.837
-we'd only get in his way.
-[grunts]

05:27.917 --> 05:30.967
Obviously. And you wouldn't
just get in his way,

05:31.047 --> 05:32.757
you'd be knocked out instantly.

05:32.837 --> 05:34.177
[BOY] I know.

05:34.257 --> 05:36.007
Maybe that's the reason
he's been hanging out

05:36.097 --> 05:38.217
with Evi lately. Just think.

05:39.467 --> 05:41.727
You're right!
Two beefcakes ready for battle.

05:42.767 --> 05:44.727
-[ALBERT] Hustle!
-[EVI] Muscle!

05:45.687 --> 05:46.727
[GIRL 4] Hey.

05:47.687 --> 05:50.277
[GIRL 5] I wonder how
Amelia's gonna handle all this.

05:50.357 --> 05:53.947
Whatcha think? She is the new
Magic Chevalier champion.

05:54.027 --> 05:55.197
[ELISA] Uh...

05:55.487 --> 05:58.027
I have a feeling she's not
gonna be too interested.

05:58.117 --> 05:59.617
[muffled]
I guess that makes sense.

05:59.697 --> 06:02.577
She probably has no reason
to enter the competition now.

06:02.657 --> 06:04.117
Yeah, you're right.

06:07.377 --> 06:08.957
[sighs softly]

06:09.047 --> 06:10.007
[chuckles]

06:10.757 --> 06:12.717
I can't sit still.

06:13.927 --> 06:16.757
I noticed Ray reading this
love story by Luna Ether,

06:16.837 --> 06:19.757
so I decided to read it
for myself. [exclaims excitedly]

06:19.847 --> 06:23.267
I never would have expected it
to pierce my soul like this.

06:24.017 --> 06:25.517
-Oh, La sta-- Uh?
-[knock on door]

06:27.767 --> 06:29.147
Who might you be?

06:29.227 --> 06:31.857
It's Ariane. I have come
to request that you compete

06:31.937 --> 06:33.567
in the Magicks War with me.

06:33.647 --> 06:35.147
-[knocking on door]
-Amelia?

06:35.237 --> 06:36.617
Come on, open the door.

06:36.697 --> 06:37.527
-[sighs wearily]
-Amelia?

06:37.617 --> 06:39.067
I'm coming.

06:39.657 --> 06:40.657
It's true.

06:41.367 --> 06:43.327
We came here to ask if you want
to enter the Magicks War with...

06:43.407 --> 06:44.577
us?

06:45.407 --> 06:47.417
Uh? [shrieks]

06:47.497 --> 06:50.667
[screaming]

06:53.457 --> 06:55.337
So you're entering
the thing, right?

06:56.427 --> 06:57.547
Yes, indeed!

06:58.217 --> 07:00.637
Hmm. And what about you, Ray?

07:00.717 --> 07:02.927
I'm gonna talk to my master
about it first,

07:03.017 --> 07:04.057
but I'd like to enter.

07:05.057 --> 07:06.347
Are you in good form, then?

07:06.437 --> 07:08.147
Not to toot my own horn,

07:08.727 --> 07:09.857
but it's not bad.

07:09.937 --> 07:10.817
I see.

07:10.897 --> 07:11.977
-[crockery clatters]
-Hmm.

07:12.857 --> 07:16.107
May I ask, is there something
you'd like to discuss, Ray?

07:16.197 --> 07:17.817
-Uh.
-[AMELIA] Hey.

07:17.907 --> 07:18.817
Huh?

07:18.907 --> 07:20.487
If we're going to be a team,

07:20.567 --> 07:23.537
shouldn't you be honest with
Ariane about what's going on?

07:23.617 --> 07:24.617
You're right.

07:25.447 --> 07:27.827
I suppose she deserves
a proper explanation.

07:27.917 --> 07:29.827
[ARIANE]
What are you talking about?

07:29.917 --> 07:30.997
Ariane...

07:32.547 --> 07:34.167
...I am the Iceblade Sorcerer.

07:36.257 --> 07:38.587
[ARIANE]
Huh? I'm sorry, what was that?

07:38.677 --> 07:40.677
I'm certain I must
have misheard what you said,

07:40.757 --> 07:43.137
so could you please repeat
yourself so I can be sure?

07:44.847 --> 07:47.267
I am one
of the seven grand sorcerers.

07:47.347 --> 07:49.227
I am the Iceblade Sorcerer.

07:49.307 --> 07:50.267
Huh?

07:50.357 --> 07:51.977
[exclaims in disbelief] Amelia?

07:53.017 --> 07:54.107
Yeah.

07:54.187 --> 07:56.237
How long have you
known about this?

07:56.317 --> 07:57.777
Good question.

07:57.857 --> 08:00.567
Since before
the Magic Chevalier, I guess.

08:01.617 --> 08:02.617
Uh.

08:02.697 --> 08:04.787
-[ARIANE] Unfair.
-Huh?

08:04.867 --> 08:06.747
-It's so unfair!
-Uh...

08:06.827 --> 08:08.457
I'd already heard the rumors

08:08.537 --> 08:10.167
that you two
were training together,

08:10.247 --> 08:11.577
and I never, for the life of me,

08:11.667 --> 08:13.497
understood why you'd be
training with him!

08:13.587 --> 08:15.757
The thought of it
drove me absolutely crazy!

08:15.837 --> 08:18.587
So that's what really
was going on!

08:19.217 --> 08:20.717
And I'll say it again...

08:21.507 --> 08:22.677
-that's so unfair!
-[gasps]

08:22.757 --> 08:24.347
You got one-on-one training

08:24.427 --> 08:27.637
from one of the most incredible
people in the whole world! Mm.

08:27.727 --> 08:29.977
I, uh... I know.

08:30.557 --> 08:31.937
I'm really sorry.

08:32.017 --> 08:33.307
[Ariane whines]

08:33.397 --> 08:34.647
Well?

08:34.727 --> 08:36.357
Do you believe what I said?

08:36.437 --> 08:37.437
[sighs heavily]

08:38.107 --> 08:40.697
I suppose that puts a few things
into perspective.

08:40.777 --> 08:42.317
So does that mean...

08:42.947 --> 08:44.527
Yeah, I believe you.

08:45.617 --> 08:46.577
[RAY] Great.

08:46.997 --> 08:49.327
Then why don't we revisit
the past for a bit?

08:51.417 --> 08:53.537
[WOMAN 1] Hey, ladies,
what are you doing after this?

08:53.627 --> 08:55.747
-Wanna grab a drink?
-[WOMAN 2] Why not?

08:56.247 --> 08:57.457
You in, Lydia?

08:57.547 --> 08:59.757
Guess once in a while
can't hurt.

08:59.837 --> 09:00.837
Care to join us?

09:00.917 --> 09:03.137
Yes, I'd be happy to go.

09:03.217 --> 09:04.427
[WOMAN 3] Master Lydia.

09:04.507 --> 09:05.427
Huh?

09:05.507 --> 09:07.177
I need to talk to you.

09:07.257 --> 09:09.347
I guess that means
you're coming, too.

09:09.427 --> 09:10.977
-I'm sorry?
-[smirks]

09:12.807 --> 09:14.727
[Ariane sobbing]

09:15.517 --> 09:17.067
[RAY]
After everything that happened,

09:17.147 --> 09:18.647
that's how I'm here now.

09:21.607 --> 09:23.567
I'm sorry you went through that.

09:24.817 --> 09:27.327
The Far East War was the first
where magic was used

09:27.407 --> 09:29.367
-in real large scale battles.
-[flames crackling]

09:29.447 --> 09:31.537
I heard that it was
the most devastating war

09:31.617 --> 09:33.577
in human history. [sobbing]

09:33.667 --> 09:36.877
You were forced to the front
lines at such a young age.

09:39.627 --> 09:41.417
-[sobbing]
-[chuckling] It's fine.

09:41.507 --> 09:43.967
That's where I met my master
and my other friends,

09:44.047 --> 09:45.757
and now I'm standing here
with you.

09:45.847 --> 09:47.757
Is that the same master
who gave you

09:47.847 --> 09:50.017
the Iceblade title
after the war ended?

09:50.097 --> 09:52.517
Yes. Though, since I overheated,

09:52.597 --> 09:54.847
that means I still can't
release its full power.

09:55.727 --> 09:58.437
But I did inherit the name
and station from my master.

09:58.517 --> 09:59.977
[Ariane blows nose]

10:00.067 --> 10:00.987
Ray.

10:03.567 --> 10:05.027
I challenge you!

10:05.117 --> 10:06.827
Uh, wait, what?

10:06.907 --> 10:08.577
Why would you challenge him now?

10:08.657 --> 10:11.787
Don't worry. This is merely
my fate as a maiden!

10:11.867 --> 10:14.247
Your fate as a what now?

10:14.327 --> 10:16.497
♪

10:16.957 --> 10:18.127
Name your terms.

10:18.207 --> 10:20.667
Whoever says "I yield"
loses the match.

10:21.417 --> 10:22.837
[RAY] That sounds good to me.

10:22.917 --> 10:25.587
[ARIANE] Oh, man, we haven't
done this since last time.

10:26.297 --> 10:28.137
-[RAY] That's true.
-[ARIANE] Well, you could say

10:28.217 --> 10:30.007
things were
a bit different then.

10:31.307 --> 10:33.677
We need a ref, Amelia.
Would you mind?

10:33.767 --> 10:36.687
[AMELIA] Okay.
Are you sure about this, though?

10:36.767 --> 10:37.977
When you dueled Rebecca,

10:38.057 --> 10:39.937
you ended up
using your powers on her.

10:41.227 --> 10:44.147
I know, but I assure you
I won't use them this time.

10:44.817 --> 10:47.067
Do you think you can beat Ariane
without them?

10:47.157 --> 10:48.157
Well...

10:48.237 --> 10:49.867
guess we'll find out.

10:50.577 --> 10:52.787
[AMELIA]
If that's the case, let's begin!

10:53.447 --> 10:54.867
[ARIANE] Ogre! [grunts]

11:03.087 --> 11:04.967
Hah! Huh?

11:08.047 --> 11:09.427
I yield.

11:09.507 --> 11:10.547
And I'm impressed.

11:10.637 --> 11:11.807
Huh?

11:11.887 --> 11:13.977
So did you use
some kind of special magic?

11:14.057 --> 11:17.437
No. Just used an inside code
to enhance my body.

11:18.607 --> 11:20.897
You're kidding me! There's no
way you could defeat my ogre

11:20.977 --> 11:22.477
with nothing
but some internal code.

11:22.567 --> 11:23.777
You lie! Uh?

11:23.857 --> 11:26.187
[chuckles] I'm not.
There are no lies here.

11:26.277 --> 11:27.397
[exclaims]

11:28.407 --> 11:30.987
So that's the true power
of a grand sorcerer, huh?

11:31.657 --> 11:33.447
Even when you're not
at your full strength.

11:33.537 --> 11:35.537
Still, you took me down.

11:36.117 --> 11:37.617
-Sort of.
-Mm?

11:37.707 --> 11:39.827
I mean, I did,
but it's only because

11:39.917 --> 11:41.747
I figured out your weakness.

11:41.837 --> 11:43.757
And just what do you
mean by that?

11:43.837 --> 11:45.967
That you've got
a lot of room to grow!

11:46.047 --> 11:46.967
Uh.

11:47.047 --> 11:48.047
Ariane...

11:48.797 --> 11:50.087
do you wanna get stronger?

11:52.137 --> 11:53.307
Of course I do!

11:53.387 --> 11:54.717
Now that's the spirit.

11:54.807 --> 11:56.727
Well then, Ariane Algren,

11:56.807 --> 11:59.227
you'll get a special
Ainsworth-style bootcamp!

11:59.307 --> 12:01.227
Tailored just for you!

12:01.307 --> 12:03.267
You would do that for me?

12:03.357 --> 12:05.187
[AMELIA] No, this can't be real!

12:05.277 --> 12:07.947
I already finished my bootcamp!
This is totally fine!

12:08.027 --> 12:09.697
I even have
my ranger badge already.

12:09.777 --> 12:12.027
-This is just for Ariane, right?
-That's right.

12:12.117 --> 12:13.237
[sighs in relief]

12:13.327 --> 12:14.327
That said,

12:14.617 --> 12:16.287
I'll make you
a separate training course!

12:16.367 --> 12:17.457
Wha--

12:17.827 --> 12:19.667
[RAY] For you, engaging
with magic is more pertinent

12:19.747 --> 12:21.077
than training your body.

12:21.787 --> 12:23.537
Now, for the Magicks War,

12:23.627 --> 12:25.547
we need to focus on
training your body first.

12:25.627 --> 12:28.007
The most important thing
for you two is

12:28.087 --> 12:29.757
always answer "roger."

12:29.837 --> 12:31.257
-Private Ariane...
-Huh?

12:31.337 --> 12:33.217
...do you understand?!

12:33.297 --> 12:35.807
-Yes, sir! Roger!
-Roger!

12:35.887 --> 12:37.517
Training starts at 0600!

12:37.597 --> 12:40.057
-Understood?
-[BOTH] Roger!

12:40.137 --> 12:41.097
-Sir.
-Again!

12:41.187 --> 12:44.357
-Roger! [screaming]
-[ARIANE] Huh?

12:46.647 --> 12:47.607
♪

12:47.687 --> 12:48.777
[running footsteps]

12:52.317 --> 12:54.077
-[Ray sighs]
-[WOMAN] Good morning, Ray.

12:54.157 --> 12:55.777
-And welcome back.
-Oh.

12:56.407 --> 12:58.037
Good morning, Miss Rebecca.

12:59.157 --> 13:00.497
Well, you're out early again.

13:00.577 --> 13:02.577
We finally get to work
our shift together,

13:02.667 --> 13:04.037
and I didn't wanna miss it.

13:04.127 --> 13:05.837
How are you feeling these days?

13:05.917 --> 13:08.627
I'm good, all thanks
to your help, of course.

13:08.717 --> 13:11.047
And I can use magic
without problems now.

13:11.677 --> 13:12.837
I'm happy to hear that.

13:12.927 --> 13:14.217
You really saved me.

13:14.297 --> 13:16.387
If it weren't
for the spell you cast on me,

13:16.467 --> 13:18.307
I don't know
that I'd still be here.

13:21.597 --> 13:23.897
Speaking of, I heard
that you signed yourself up

13:23.977 --> 13:25.897
-for the Magicks War?
-Yeah.

13:26.517 --> 13:28.437
I'm gonna form a team
with Amelia and Ariane.

13:29.147 --> 13:31.147
Huh? [whimpers]

13:31.237 --> 13:32.777
What? What's wrong?

13:32.857 --> 13:35.617
You're going in surrounded
by girls, that's what.

13:35.697 --> 13:36.827
That's not true.

13:36.907 --> 13:38.747
Evi and Albert will be there,

13:38.827 --> 13:40.907
and the other guys from the ERC.

13:41.577 --> 13:43.707
You've got a point, but still,

13:44.497 --> 13:46.587
I'd like to be there
by your side, too.

13:46.667 --> 13:48.917
You shouldn't push yourself
right now.

13:49.007 --> 13:51.087
I can't help
but worry about you.

13:51.167 --> 13:53.797
Uh, you worry about me?

13:54.547 --> 13:55.757
Yeah.

13:55.847 --> 13:58.007
I often find myself
thinking about you.

13:58.097 --> 13:59.597
[Rebecca in sing-song] Jackpot!

13:59.677 --> 14:01.427
Oh, I highly doubt that.

14:01.517 --> 14:02.927
You're so funny, Ray.

14:03.017 --> 14:04.517
I know you're nice and all,
but...

14:04.597 --> 14:05.937
-Hmm?
-...seriously.

14:07.357 --> 14:08.647
Oh, Ray.

14:08.727 --> 14:09.817
Yeah, what's up?

14:09.897 --> 14:10.937
[AMELIA] Ray!

14:11.027 --> 14:12.317
[RAY] Amelia.

14:12.397 --> 14:14.067
-I figured I'd find you here.
-[REBECCA] Tsk!

14:14.147 --> 14:17.027
Now then, I had a couple
of questions about my training.

14:17.117 --> 14:19.577
Got it. I'll meet you
in the classroom after this.

14:19.657 --> 14:21.037
All right. Thank you.

14:21.117 --> 14:22.457
-[Rebecca clears throat]
-Hmm?

14:23.077 --> 14:25.417
Amelia, it's so good
to see you again.

14:25.497 --> 14:26.537
Kinokon!

14:26.957 --> 14:29.087
Funny, I was just thinking
the same thing, Rebecca.

14:29.167 --> 14:30.667
Takepoko, takepoko!

14:30.757 --> 14:32.007
I forgot to tell you,

14:32.087 --> 14:33.757
I'll make sure to send him
right over

14:33.837 --> 14:35.087
once the two of us are finished

14:35.177 --> 14:37.547
enjoying our nice and intimate
breakfast alone.

14:37.637 --> 14:38.717
I want curry!

14:39.007 --> 14:40.557
-Oh? Are you abusing...
-They have hayashi rice,

14:40.637 --> 14:41.807
-too!
-...your position now?

14:41.887 --> 14:44.427
I could be wrong,
but you would know best,

14:44.517 --> 14:46.347
Miss President
of the Student Council.

14:46.437 --> 14:47.937
[REBECCA]
Oh, no, I think you're getting

14:48.017 --> 14:49.357
the wrong message, Miss Amelia.

14:49.437 --> 14:50.977
-[both chuckle wryly]
-Kinokon!

14:51.067 --> 14:52.357
Takepoko!

14:53.277 --> 14:54.857
[RAY]
What's with all this pressure?

14:54.947 --> 14:57.117
And why are there
strange animals?

14:57.907 --> 14:59.157
-[REBECCA] One moment.
-[Amelia grunts]

14:59.237 --> 15:00.577
Uh...

15:02.537 --> 15:04.077
What are you doing to me?

15:04.157 --> 15:05.327
-For real?
-Amelia.

15:05.407 --> 15:06.667
Yeah, what's up?

15:07.287 --> 15:09.037
[REBECCA]
Can you and I make a deal?

15:09.127 --> 15:10.127
[AMELIA] A deal?

15:10.747 --> 15:11.707
Well, I...

15:11.797 --> 15:13.627
I can't seem
to shake this feeling.

15:14.337 --> 15:16.047
Maybe I could help you
if I knew more.

15:16.127 --> 15:17.507
I'm worried about Ariane.

15:17.587 --> 15:18.637
Okay, how so?

15:18.717 --> 15:19.757
[REBECCA] She's gonna be doing

15:19.847 --> 15:21.507
a lot of physical training
with Ray,

15:21.597 --> 15:24.307
and they'll be at it
all day long, alone.

15:24.387 --> 15:26.267
[AMELIA] Yeah,
I suppose that's true, but--

15:26.347 --> 15:27.727
[REBECCA] That's dangerous!

15:27.807 --> 15:29.727
I'm sure she also
thinks of Ray as--

15:29.807 --> 15:30.977
[AMELIA] Her? No way!

15:31.057 --> 15:32.767
-I don't think--
-Put your hand on your heart

15:32.857 --> 15:34.397
and really think
about what I said.

15:34.487 --> 15:37.067
I'm sure you know
exactly what I mean.

15:39.157 --> 15:40.987
[RAY] I wanna be here, with you.

15:41.527 --> 15:43.327
Amelia, get up!

15:43.407 --> 15:44.497
Wanna bite this apple?

15:44.577 --> 15:46.247
-[yelps]
-What do you say?

15:46.327 --> 15:48.707
Well, it's hard to say,
but I still...

15:48.787 --> 15:51.247
You know he's oblivious
to how charming he is,

15:51.337 --> 15:53.037
and we cannot afford
to have another girl

15:53.127 --> 15:54.417
getting swept off her feet.

15:55.257 --> 15:57.217
Look at me
and tell me I'm not right!

15:57.297 --> 15:58.757
[whimpers]

16:01.257 --> 16:02.547
[groans]

16:03.307 --> 16:04.177
Uh?

16:04.257 --> 16:05.887
-Ray!
-Ariane invited you

16:05.977 --> 16:07.767
to join her team, didn't she?

16:07.847 --> 16:09.437
-[RAY] Yeah.
-[sighs]

16:09.517 --> 16:10.857
Now that I'm thinking about it,

16:10.937 --> 16:13.187
I'm sure you two would
totally vibe well together,

16:13.267 --> 16:14.607
personality-wise.

16:14.687 --> 16:16.527
[RAY] Does that mean
you know her really well?

16:16.607 --> 16:18.987
Well, we've met
at noble parties before.

16:19.067 --> 16:20.357
Uh, how should I put this?

16:20.447 --> 16:22.737
Oh, I know! She's eager.

16:22.827 --> 16:25.197
[RAY]
True. She is really passionate.

16:25.287 --> 16:26.827
Spiritually, I mean.

16:26.907 --> 16:28.827
Yeah, I could totally see that.

16:28.907 --> 16:31.247
[GIRL] I get that feeling
when I'm around her.

16:31.917 --> 16:33.337
[RAY]
Your assessment wasn't far off.

16:36.377 --> 16:37.467
[door opens]

16:37.547 --> 16:38.507
[AMELIA] Excuse me!

16:39.757 --> 16:40.717
Come right in.

16:40.797 --> 16:42.217
How can I help you?

16:45.097 --> 16:46.217
Uh.

16:46.307 --> 16:47.477
Huh?

16:48.887 --> 16:51.267
-You know why I'm here.
-Mm-hmm.

16:51.347 --> 16:53.647
So we're entering
a non-aggression treaty

16:53.727 --> 16:56.227
for the duration
of the tournament, I see.

16:56.317 --> 16:58.317
♪

16:59.817 --> 17:01.197
What's going on?

17:01.277 --> 17:02.987
-[REBECCA] Dina.
-Oh! Yes, ma'am?

17:03.737 --> 17:05.487
May I ask a favor?

17:06.157 --> 17:07.487
Yeah.

17:07.577 --> 17:09.497
[footsteps treading]

17:10.287 --> 17:11.407
[BOY] Took you long enough.

17:12.077 --> 17:14.037
[RAY]
Evi! Albert, you're here, too?

17:14.127 --> 17:17.247
We heard you formed a team
with Lady Ariane and Amelia.

17:17.337 --> 17:18.917
-Yeah.
-[chuckles]

17:19.007 --> 17:21.127
You know I would have
said "yes," right?

17:21.217 --> 17:22.677
I'm sorry.

17:22.757 --> 17:24.427
No, we're actually thrilled.

17:24.507 --> 17:25.717
We're pumped to see
what it's like

17:25.807 --> 17:27.387
to fight against you.

17:27.467 --> 17:28.677
So, you two...

17:28.767 --> 17:31.597
Oh, yeah.
We decided to form our own team.

17:31.687 --> 17:33.437
From now on, we'll be rivals.

17:34.107 --> 17:35.557
Teams have three people, though.

17:35.647 --> 17:36.937
Who's your third, then?

17:37.017 --> 17:39.227
[scoffs]
That's a real good question.

17:39.317 --> 17:40.817
We don't have anyone yet.

17:42.237 --> 17:43.697
[BOTH] We know who, though.

17:44.367 --> 17:46.907
I see. Then good luck to us all.

17:46.987 --> 17:47.987
Yeah.

17:48.737 --> 17:49.827
[Albert chuckles lightly]

17:51.077 --> 17:52.367
To us all, my friends.

17:53.037 --> 17:54.827
-[birds chirping]
-[LYDIA] Oh, Ray!

17:54.917 --> 17:56.377
Did you get even taller?

17:56.997 --> 17:58.167
[RAY] I can't say I did, Master.

17:58.837 --> 18:01.507
[LYDIA]
I see. So what's on your mind?

18:01.587 --> 18:03.167
[RAY] Right. Actually...

18:03.257 --> 18:05.177
Ah, about the Magicks War.

18:05.257 --> 18:06.757
[chuckles] Fast as always.

18:06.847 --> 18:08.007
[chuckles]

18:08.097 --> 18:09.347
I think you should do it.

18:10.017 --> 18:11.977
Your overheating's gotten
way better, right?

18:12.057 --> 18:13.687
Yes. So then...

18:13.767 --> 18:16.687
Go nuts. You're free to do
as you please, Ray.

18:16.767 --> 18:17.897
[Ray chuckles]

18:17.977 --> 18:19.067
Oh, by the way...

18:19.147 --> 18:20.227
[WOMAN] Mm?

18:20.857 --> 18:23.237
Hey, Mr. Ray White.

18:23.317 --> 18:24.567
Been quite a while.

18:25.737 --> 18:26.737
[RAY] Lieselotte.

18:27.737 --> 18:29.867
I just came here
to speak with you is all.

18:30.487 --> 18:33.287
And I guess I did need
to ask Lydia for advice.

18:33.367 --> 18:35.117
Ha! More like you forced me

18:35.207 --> 18:36.127
-to give it to ya.
-Then you couldn't have

18:36.207 --> 18:37.667
-timed it better.
-[LYDIA] Hey!

18:37.747 --> 18:40.377
[RAY] I had something I wanted
to discuss with you, too.

18:41.167 --> 18:43.007
[birds chirping]

18:43.087 --> 18:45.007
[grunting]

18:45.927 --> 18:47.637
[ARIANE]
Why, hello there, Amelia!

18:48.257 --> 18:50.097
-[chuckles softly]
-Good morning, Ariane.

18:51.597 --> 18:52.717
-Huh?
-[grunting]

18:52.807 --> 18:54.097
Is there something on your mind?

18:54.177 --> 18:56.387
Not exactly. It's just that

18:57.017 --> 18:57.977
I, uh--

18:58.057 --> 18:59.607
[RAY] Amelia! Ariane!

18:59.687 --> 19:01.527
-Morning!
-[exclaims]

19:01.937 --> 19:02.897
He's here!

19:03.187 --> 19:05.897
-Ray! Good morning to you, too.
-[exclaims]

19:06.487 --> 19:08.407
That is you, right?

19:08.947 --> 19:10.197
[sighs in relief]

19:10.277 --> 19:11.407
-[RAY] All right.
-Uh?

19:11.487 --> 19:13.867
Let's begin
with a 20-kilometer run.

19:13.947 --> 19:15.367
Are you ready?

19:15.457 --> 19:17.167
I am, sir! Roger!

19:17.247 --> 19:18.917
I guess some things
never change, huh?

19:18.997 --> 19:21.127
-[RAY] What was that, Private?
-[whimpers]

19:21.797 --> 19:25.257
Ruh... Roger!

19:25.757 --> 19:26.757
[BOTH] Roger!

19:27.217 --> 19:29.177
[BOTH] Roger!

19:29.257 --> 19:31.137
[BOTH] Roger!

19:32.677 --> 19:33.637
[Amelia panting]

19:34.307 --> 19:36.637
I've always wondered what
the Ainsworth-style bootcamp

19:36.727 --> 19:38.477
-would be like.
-[groans]

19:38.557 --> 19:40.397
Why do I have to go
through this again?

19:41.067 --> 19:42.777
[RAY] This was a demonstration
before we start

19:42.857 --> 19:44.647
-our real training.
-[Amelia groaning]

19:45.317 --> 19:48.107
Private Amelia, you'll start
something next Monday.

19:48.197 --> 19:50.317
It's a special two-week
training program.

19:50.827 --> 19:52.027
[exclaims] Uh?

19:52.617 --> 19:53.537
What is it?

19:53.617 --> 19:55.247
Find out next week.

19:55.327 --> 19:57.327
And if you happen
to make it back alive,

19:57.407 --> 19:59.127
your magical abilities
will increase

19:59.207 --> 20:00.747
to an even higher level, too.

20:01.417 --> 20:04.547
Private Ariane, you'll sleep
and train at my house back home.

20:04.627 --> 20:05.837
-[Amelia exclaims in shock]
-[ARIANE] Yes, sir!

20:05.917 --> 20:07.297
-Roger!
-[Amelia exclaims]

20:07.377 --> 20:09.337
Now wait a fricking minute!

20:09.427 --> 20:11.887
-What's up?
-I'm coming to your house, too!

20:11.967 --> 20:12.927
It's only fair!

20:13.387 --> 20:15.347
No, what you need to train
is your magical skills.

20:15.427 --> 20:16.887
The only thing we're gonna do

20:16.977 --> 20:18.597
is some hardcore
physical training.

20:18.687 --> 20:19.727
[grunts angrily]

20:19.807 --> 20:21.187
Oh, good for you!

20:21.267 --> 20:23.147
-For me?
-You're coming with me!

20:23.227 --> 20:24.937
Ray, you stay
right where you are!

20:25.027 --> 20:28.067
Uh, whatever you're doing,
please be gentle with me.

20:29.067 --> 20:29.947
[RAY] Huh?

20:30.027 --> 20:31.367
[AMELIA] Up, up, down, down,

20:31.447 --> 20:33.277
left, right, left, right,
B, A, start.

20:33.367 --> 20:35.037
-[Ariane grunts in agreement]
-Okay.

20:35.117 --> 20:37.247
I'll accept your regimen
for now.

20:37.327 --> 20:39.907
All right.
I'm happy to hear that.

20:39.997 --> 20:41.497
So what were you talking about?

20:43.207 --> 20:44.997
[chuckles awkwardly]
Don't you worry, Ray.

20:45.087 --> 20:46.587
-Just two girls gabbing.
-Mm-hmm.

20:46.667 --> 20:49.587
-[both chuckle awkwardly]
-[RAY] Hmm.

20:50.257 --> 20:52.337
I need to keep an eye
on this for sure.

20:53.887 --> 20:55.387
[REBECCA] What did you say?!

20:55.467 --> 20:58.347
-They start soon. This weekend.
-[grunts angrily]

20:59.097 --> 21:00.137
[inhales deeply]

21:00.227 --> 21:01.937
I can't believe he's doing this.

21:02.017 --> 21:03.647
He really is so oblivious.

21:04.267 --> 21:06.527
I hope nothing happens
between the two of them.

21:06.607 --> 21:08.107
Oh, I think something might.

21:08.187 --> 21:09.897
[gasps, exclaims dramatically]

21:10.567 --> 21:11.487
[sighs]

21:13.407 --> 21:15.077
[muted dialogue]

21:15.157 --> 21:17.157
♪

21:20.287 --> 21:22.537
[EVI] So you're saying
it's in the back of this place.

21:22.627 --> 21:23.537
[ALBERT] Let's go.

21:25.747 --> 21:27.377
-[bell tolling]
-[Ariane panting]

21:27.457 --> 21:29.127
You finally made it.

21:31.627 --> 21:33.137
I'm sorry I kept you waiting.

21:33.217 --> 21:34.257
[chuckles softly]

21:35.007 --> 21:37.057
You're here now. Come on!

21:37.637 --> 21:38.927
[ARIANE] Yes! Roger!

21:39.017 --> 21:40.517
[panting]

21:43.977 --> 21:46.647
Ariane,
it's just past this field.

21:48.147 --> 21:49.647
Sir, yes, sir-- [grunts]

21:49.727 --> 21:50.897
[groans]

21:52.237 --> 21:53.907
Did something happen, Ray?

21:56.027 --> 21:57.907
-Uh...
-[scuffling]

22:03.997 --> 22:05.957
♪

22:06.037 --> 22:07.417
[girl yelling] Pow!

22:07.497 --> 22:08.667
Ray!

22:10.917 --> 22:12.297
[chuckling]

22:12.377 --> 22:13.417
[ARIANE] A girl?!

22:14.087 --> 22:15.467
Hey, Stella. I missed you.

22:15.547 --> 22:16.927
Wait, did you grow again?

22:17.007 --> 22:19.427
Maybe. Not a whole lot, though.

22:19.517 --> 22:21.177
You, Big Brother?

22:21.267 --> 22:22.677
[RAY] Nah, same as always.

22:22.767 --> 22:24.187
"Big Brother"?

22:24.267 --> 22:26.807
-So, Ariane.
-[Stella chuckles]

22:26.897 --> 22:28.567
My name's Stella White.

22:28.647 --> 22:30.187
I'm his little sister.

22:30.857 --> 22:32.187
Big Brother?

22:32.277 --> 22:34.197
Little sister?

22:34.277 --> 22:35.407
[chuckles]

22:36.317 --> 22:38.277
[♪ closing theme song playing]

23:48.897 --> 23:50.107
-♪ I'm Rebecca ♪
-♪ I'm Amelia ♪

23:51.267 --> 23:52.187
-♪ I'm Dina ♪
-[ALL] ♪ Here's a preview ♪

23:52.777 --> 23:53.647
[REBECCA] ♪ The Magicks War
Is coming up fast ♪

23:54.437 --> 23:55.777
[AMELIA] ♪ Training on their own
So they don't come last ♪

23:55.857 --> 23:57.487
[DINA] ♪ In a deep forest!
Deep, deep! ♪

23:57.567 --> 23:59.027
[AMELIA] ♪ In a deep forest!
Deep, deep! ♪

23:59.107 --> 24:00.737
[REBECCA] ♪ Say what!
That person shows up again! ♪

24:00.817 --> 24:02.447
[AMELIA]
♪ Say what! Better tune in! ♪

24:02.527 --> 24:04.117
[REBECCA] Next time
on The Iceblade Sorcerer

24:04.197 --> 24:05.367
Shall Rule the World!

24:05.447 --> 24:07.207
[REBECCA, AMELIA, DINA] Two!

24:07.287 --> 24:09.287
[AMELIA] Episode two
will be full of training.

24:09.377 --> 24:11.587
[ALL] And it's "The Boy Who Is
The World's Strongest Sorcerer

24:11.667 --> 24:12.837
Dons a Mask."

24:12.917 --> 24:13.957
[AMELIA] Again?
